From: OpenEmbedded <oe@oe-alliance.org>
Date: 2026-05-02
Subject: [PATCH] crypto: replace OPENSSL_atexit with atexit for OpenSSL 4.0

OpenSSL 4.0 removed OPENSSL_atexit(). Use standard atexit() instead.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: OpenEmbedded <oe@oe-alliance.org>

diff -urN a/src/libtscore/crypto/private/tsInitCryptoLibrary.cpp b/src/libtscore/crypto/private/tsInitCryptoLibrary.cpp
--- a/src/libtscore/crypto/private/tsInitCryptoLibrary.cpp	2026-05-02 17:34:45.301215926 +0200
+++ b/src/libtscore/crypto/private/tsInitCryptoLibrary.cpp	2026-05-02 17:34:55.164346836 +0200
@@ -8,6 +8,7 @@
 
 #include "tsInitCryptoLibrary.h"
 #include "tsEnvironment.h"
+#include <cstdlib>
 
 
 //----------------------------------------------------------------------------
@@ -73,7 +74,7 @@
 ts::TerminateWithOpenSSL::Repo::Repo()
 {
     active = true;
-    OPENSSL_atexit(exitHandler);
+    atexit(exitHandler);
 }
 
 // Destructor may be called before exitHandler().
